Due to variability in paths, details of netcdf files, and the like, in 
    general there are 3 files for each model:

.vars -- lists the .nc variable names and, on the first line, flags 
            whether nx is output before (1) or after (2) ny in the .nc
model.sh -- for each model, has the details about running the processor 
            for that model
model_runup.sh -- for each model, controls running up over a history
  
ufs.vars
retro.sh
retro_runup.sh

rtofs.vars
rtofs.sh
runup.sh

